{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261015/photo/bkn-20261015195814779-1015_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261015214900\"/><p>今晚(15日)攪珠的今年第110期六合彩，攪珠結果為3、7、8、10、36、42，特別號碼20。頭獎無人中；二獎1注中，每注派彩1,289,950港元；三獎91.5注中，每注派37,590港元。</p><p>下期六合彩將於周六(17日)晚上9時30分攪珠，估計頭獎基金達13,000,000港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T14:00:10.685257+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T11:58:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T13:58:12.272451+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:58:12.272451+00:00","content_hash":"62bbd57d0f33dfea4b7ae796c744be0376f62a2f9cea5fcc87f060058b009980","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}